= Tractor Submit =

"""Sends every render layer wired into it to the farm as one Tractor job."""

Wire each layer's last Tractor node into an input: Tractor Configure, or the Tractor Denoise or Tractor Encode Video below it. Save the hip file first.

Send refuses, and says why, when it can tell the job would fail or write nothing. Nothing is sent then, and no version folder is left behind.

@parameters

Send To Tractor:
    #id: send
    Send the job. Each layer's Configure then shows the job in Last Job.

Job Title:
    #id: title
    The job's name in Tractor. Empty names it after the hip's folders and the layers, such as `A_010 lighting: char, env`.

Priority:
    #id: priority
    Tractor starts jobs of higher priority first.
